  id: twoThePowerOf
  title: Two The Power Of
  author: Infusion
  description: 'Lights, camera!


    Use the colors of lights to move through a diagram and determine their power levels.


    This is one of my more lengthy modules, but it has some interesting concepts,
    such as a diagram and a potential rotation of the module, which I haven''t used
    in any of my modules before.


    Manual can be found at ktane.timwi.de or in the bundled manuals folder.

    Source code is at https://github.com/Infusion478/KTANE-Two-The-Power-Of


    Comes with Twitch Plays, colorblind, AND rule seed support!'
  version: 1.0
  outputFolder: build
